<html>
<head>
<style>
/* Sets the whole page background to sky blue and default text color/font */
body {
background-color: #00BFFF;
color: #330000;
font-family: Verdana;
}

/* Header section holding the tavern name */
div.header {
background-color: #ccaa66;
text-align: center;
padding: 10px;
}
/* text-align:center makes the heading sit in the middle like the picture shows */

/* Left navigation column with the menu links */
div.nav {
float: left;
width: 120px;
background-color: #E8D882;
height: 300px;
padding: 10px;
}
/* float:left pushes this div to the left side so the content div can sit next to it */

/* Removes the default blue underlined link style so links look plain */
div.nav a {
display: block;
color: #330000;
text-decoration: none;
}
/* display:block makes each link take its own line, like a list of menu items */

/* Right side main content area */
div.content {
float: left;
width: 400px;
background-color: #f1e8b0;
height: 300px;
padding: 10px;
}
/* float:left again so this sits right next to the nav div, forming two columns */

/* Footer section at the bottom of the page */
div.footer {
clear: both;
background-color: #ccaa66;
text-align: center;
padding: 10px;
}
/* clear:both is needed here because nav and content are floated - 
   without it, the footer would try to float up next to them instead of staying below */
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Header with the pub name -->
<div class="header">
<h1>Stinky Pete's Pirate Tavern</h1>
</div>

<!-- Left navigation menu -->
<div class="nav">
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#">Grog</a>
<a href="#">Shanties</a>
<a href="#">Become a swab</a>
</div>

<!-- Main content with the description and list of items -->
<div class="content">
<p>Avast maties! Here ye'll be findin' all these delights...</p>
<ul>
<li>Great grog</li>
<li>All the rum you can drink</li>
<li>Good honest pirate fare like weevily biscuits and stewed rat</li>
<li>Wenches and swabs for every taste</li>
<li>Salty seadogs singin' shanties</li>
</ul>
<p>Berth 23<br>
Nottingham Docks<br>
0115 9324567</p>
</div>

<!-- Footer with copyright and contact email -->
<div class="footer">
Copyright &copy; 2011 Stinky Pete's Pirate Tavern<br>
stinkypete@arrrr.com
</div>

</body>
</html>